{"id":"0516e51f5ae8a319","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-product-per-quotient.md","title":"积 PER 商集与分量商集的双射","display":"thm-product-per-quotient — 积 PER 商集与分量商集的双射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-product-per-quotient","aliases":["72-thm-product-per-quotient"],"display":"thm-product-per-quotient — 积 PER 商集与分量商集的双射","depends_on":["[[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]","[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 product PER, print746/PDF758; local quotient consequence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-product-per-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-product-per-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-product-per-quotient — 积 PER 商集与分量商集的双射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c65f237e17c892c\" href=\"?note=5c65f237e17c892c\" title=\"72-df-per-cartesian-product\">72-df-per-cartesian-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 product PER, print746/PDF758; local quotient consequence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>α、β、pair、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e\">\\(\\mathfrak e\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c65f237e17c892c\" href=\"?note=5c65f237e17c892c\" title=\"72-df-per-cartesian-product\">72-df-per-cartesian-product</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\">\\(R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\)</span>；类与商取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|\\alpha|\">\\(a\\in|\\alpha|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in|\\beta|\">\\(b\\in|\\beta|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\beta|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\beta|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}(|\\alpha|/\\alpha)\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}(|\\alpha|/\\alpha)\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一 R 支撑项求值为某个 pair(a,b)，并与该规范 pair 相关，因此所有类均在 q 的定义域。若两规范 pair 相关，确定性和自求值使分量分别 α、β 相关；反向由构造即得。由此 q 与代表选择无关且单射，每一对分量类由相应 pair 给出，故满射。空分量时两边均空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-per-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-per-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"5c65f237e17c892c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"α、β、pair、$\\mathfrak e$ 取 [[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]，$R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta$；类与商取 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。$a\\in|\\alpha|$、$b\\in|\\beta|$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"α、β、pair、$\\mathfrak e$ 取 [[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]，$R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta$；类与商取 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。$a\\in|\\alpha|$、$b\\in|\\beta|$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e","display":false},{"tex":"R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in|\\alpha|","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in|\\beta|","display":false},{"tex":"q:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\beta|\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"q:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}(|\\alpha|/\\alpha)\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1629,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-576","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"}],"outgoing":["5c65f237e17c892c","855f0d0656844c14"]}